    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/1140148f-2a7d-4ee9-a2a0-a595c0a43f54-01/AwardCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_AwardingTerms1_AwardingCriterion1_SubordinateAwardingCriterion2>,
